@*
    A type per query window.

    The docking host takes a panel *type* and draws its registered title on the tab, so two tabs of
    one type would both be called "Query". A type per window is what gives the second one a name of
    its own; the statement each holds lives in DatabaseSession, keyed by the same id.
*@
<DatabaseQueryPanel PanelId="@FilePanelIds.DatabaseQueries[0]" />
